{
  "analysis": "The link test is now showing undefined references. These are mostly libc functions (memset, memcpy, printf, exit, strcasecmp, etc.) and platform functions from i_video.c/i_input.c that may be missing or excluded. I need the full list of undefined symbols to build a minimal runtime. The output is still continuing, so I should capture the full link errors to a file and then inspect them.",
  "plan": "Run the link command again with all output captured to a file, then extract and sort the unique undefined symbols. This will guide the minimal libc implementation.",
  "commands": [
    {
      "keystrokes": "cd /app/doomgeneric/doomgeneric && mipsel-linux-gnu-ld -EL -m elf32ltsmip -nostdlib -o /tmp/doomgeneric_test build_mips/*.o 2>/tmp/link_errors.txt; echo \"exit=$?\"; sed -n 's/.*undefined reference to `\\([^'\\'']*\\)'.*/\\1/p' /tmp/link_errors.txt | sort -u | head -200\n",
      "duration": 1.0
    }
  ]
}
